{"type":"message","id":"e7f9a754","parentId":"2044b74d","timestamp":"2026-03-24T03:32:18.012Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## 📋 配置更新总结\n\n### ✅ **已完成的操作**\n1. **Primary 模型**: 已设置为 `mimo/mimo-v2-flash`\n2. **Fallback 顺序**: \n   - 1. `mimo/mimo-v2-pro`\n   - 2. `openai-codex/gpt-5.4` \n   - 3. `arkcode/deepseek-v3.2`\n3. **删除 provider**: 已完全移除 `hgapi` 配置\n\n### 🔧 **当前模型配置**\n```\n主模型: MiMo-V2-Flash (快速响应)\n备用模型: \n  1. MiMo-V2-Pro (高质量)\n  2. GPT-5.4 (Codex)\n  3. DeepSeek V3.2 (备用)\n```\n\n### 🚀 **配置优势**\n- **MiMo-V2-Flash**: 响应速度快，适合日常交互\n- **MiMo-V2-Pro**: 作为高质量备用，处理复杂任务\n- **简化配置**: 移除不用的 hgapi，减少配置复杂度\n- **优化性能**: Flash 模型提升日常响应速度\n\n### 📊 **验证结果**\n- ✅ openclaw.json 配置已更新\n- ✅ hgapi provider 已完全删除\n- ✅ OpenClaw 服务正常运行\n- ✅ 当前模型切换正常\n\n现在你可以享受更快速的 MiMo-V2-Flash 模型响应了！如果遇到任何模型切换问题，我会自动回退到备用模型。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"arkcode","model":"deepseek-v3.2","usage":{"input":46499,"output":320,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":46819,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774323112914}}
