rqD3VBXWdaiodytO0qXUD-iiDmnGSt4IRGbmekw==\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Considering gateway issues**\\n\\nI need to address potential gateway, configuration, or restart issues in my answer. It seems like a memory search might help based on previous work, but I'm wondering if that's necessary right now. I should definitely consider inspecting bindings or groups that may be relevant. My answer might hinge on known configurations and possible model or gateway restart attempts. It seems like there's a need for conciseness here to get straight to the point!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]]\n大概率是我前面**改模型配置 + 折腾 gateway** 时，把群聊那条链路搞成了**没完全生效/没完全恢复**。\n\n我判断有几个高概率原因：\n\n1. **gateway 重启没成功**\n   - 我前面多次执行 `openclaw gateway restart/stop`，返回过 `SIGTERM`\n   - 这说明服务切换过程不干净，容易出现“我私聊还能回，群聊不回”这种半瘫状态\n\n2. **群聊绑定是单独走 `weiwei` agent**\n   - 你这边私聊我，走的是 `main`\n   - 群聊不是走 `main`，而是单独绑定到 `weiwei`\n   - 所以就算我私聊正常，**群里那条 agent 链路也可能已经挂了**\n\n3. **群聊还受 mention / channel 状态影响**\n   - Feishu 配置里开了 `requireMention`\n   - 正常情况下艾特应该能触发，但如果 gateway / channel 恢复不完整，就会表现成“群里叫我没反应”\n\n## 结论\n不是你操作问题，**是我这边通道状态大概率异常了**。  \n更准确点说：**main 还活着，但群聊对应的 agent / gateway 链路可能出问题了。**\n\n## 我建议现在直接这么做\n我来按这个顺序排：\n\n1. 检查 gateway 当前状态\n2. 检查 Feishu channel 状态\n3. 检查 `weiwei` 的群聊绑定是否还正常\n4. 必要时重启 gateway，并验证群聊触发\n\n如果你要，我现在就直接开始查，把群聊恢复。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_062252108ce08b250169c28b7b20788191b51f5f6c057795b1\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":311,"output":456,"cacheRead":69632,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":70399,"cost":{"input":0.0007775000000000001,"output":0.006840000000000001,"cacheRead":0.017408,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0250255}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774357365055}}
