{"type":"message","id":"f6d3ac78","parentId":"37d6a34a","timestamp":"2026-03-24T13:04:09.210Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_062252108ce08b250169c28bc15990819197058a1fc79c2c22\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpwovCPOH7P2UInLMNtSUmaQwBm1dpbybqNAE2qAbv4jFGzg0kDWojggiB6-ku7xJ7vbOzLR5n7lPPvyKfW08BO573_14Y5UbxV8rmEWsi2PnehoZGeK4ngnjR0a9nt4w2Ne18zj3HFaQHAaveSnpgnuAXykY57VK77_JWeYhQLiad1eXS7U8W3R4gSdWBVmadwRYB28RDNbuyEJzbe-MOkVTNPEJFmkKY447p1GpLNVi6LkspWFVMP-muVwJeslGGhV4m7GSh_dWMwcHzG3qeHlikmXsuMDQff5Xgw4zSnI8Hpk1Ak6OOa1X218caNyTEqMGfpbe7mMvevWpElg7ckmvzgtC2En2rNzxLkNo2eoZY1mYBwHjLfQYOvgz_AH6YmaT3aeqfu52jNKon6O89b3U-VZeLTzdUFi7A1MR80w8pRNxLi0UQlFlyjTC8bha0PGW_q0zHyOzrSGfx3Q6Rc6p7X4vceU5hmQ28CJNl12NU6rYDNBM20gKIIpw4hzmr6Hj_w6T5m8lW5slgnRGKjySo66A_tRqnlDog25qnlFLHQEfYNfOYQYLS3BrvtMZ2ri8y0TUQzYpM8S4EjFS0jL0_rdc2XcMlJkQ1b9ZzBurDwbUkEKCyIOBd9I0dX0Ah79D8OPNfPAUI7RE6xsUIRbpCxMREtvivB3oQrqW0nsB-l8sf7KclI18SP-4JNwrHJyZBMxzUW2Kq9NMqiHnvS0nkNrbUyXy1FP65gf_a_GicPIBIFjcUkK0pIQwHZfB2hCaXQlSt_LlDbxuAVU6Hd3VLNo3vMfz9Jhcw1vEjmmKTsDT4SR_WMwY1bFYpfptYloZeQn4uzc3zXU1dxjmCAaEnig==\",\"summary\":[]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]]\n查完了，结论很明确：\n\n## 1）Gateway 当前状态\n**正常**\n- Runtime: `running`\n- RPC probe: `ok`\n- 正在监听 `*:34459`\n\n补充一个风险点：\n- 现在 systemd 服务配置 **有点旧**，Node 路径走的是 nvm：\n  `/root/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.1/bin/node`\n- 这不是这次群聊失灵的直接原因，但属于后面该收拾的坑\n\n## 2）Feishu channel 状态\n**也正常**\n我查到 5 个 Feishu 账号都显示：\n- `enabled`\n- `configured`\n- `running`\n- `works`\n\n包括你关心的群聊对应账号：\n- **Feishu weiwei: enabled, configured, running, works**\n\n---\n\n## 当前判断\n这说明：\n- **gateway 没挂**\n- **Feishu 通道没挂**\n- **weiwei 账号本身也没挂**\n\n所以“群聊里没反应”更像是下面这类问题之一：\n\n1. **群消息没命中到对应 agent 绑定**\n   - 群聊是单独绑给 `weiwei` 的，不走当前这个 `main`\n\n2. **群里触发条件没满足**\n   - 比如 mention / 消息格式 / 群消息路由条件\n\n3. **群聊 session 或投递链路有局部问题**\n   - 通道健康，但具体这一个群的会话路由没打中\n\n---\n\n## 下一步最该查\n如果你同意，我下一步直接查这两项：\n1. **检查 `weiwei` 的群聊绑定是否命中这个群 ID**\n2. **检查最近群聊事件/会话记录，看消息有没有进到 `weiwei`**\n\n这两步查完，基本就能定位。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_062252108ce08b250169c28bc221c881919c7f61d3ffd02a9a\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":717,"output":424,"cacheRead":71040,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":72181,"cost":{"input":0.0017925,"output":0.00636,"cacheRead":0.017759999999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.025912499999999998}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774357439222}}
