{"type":"message","id":"2c6d1746","parentId":"5ddf68c6","timestamp":"2026-03-24T13:09:35.309Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]]\n能看到你发来的这个群 ID：\n\n- `oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3`\n\n但**在当前配置里，它没有绑定到任何 agent**。\n\n我刚查了 `openclaw.json`，现在配置里只有一个群聊绑定：\n- `oc_66423c2184d18994a01eccbd30079009` → `weiwei`\n\n**没有**你刚发的这个：\n- `oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3`\n\n## 结论\n所以这个群里找我没反应，原因很直接：\n**它没被绑定，消息不会路由到任何 agent。**\n\n## 下一步\n如果你要，我现在就可以把这个群绑定上。\n\n你只要拍板一下要绑定给谁：\n\n1. **绑定给 `main`**  \n   这个最合理，群里就直接找我本体\n\n2. **绑定给 `weiwei`**  \n   如果这个群本来就是给薇薇干活用的\n\n3. **绑定给别的 agent**  \n   比如 xixi / aoao / ling\n\n我建议：**这个群先绑定给 `main`**。  \n你一句话确认，我直接改。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_062252108ce08b250169c28d047f1c81918a57582b376cd4ab\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":180,"output":289,"cacheRead":72960,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":73429,"cost":{"input":0.00045000000000000004,"output":0.004335,"cacheRead":0.01824,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.023025}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774357759693}}
