{"type":"message","id":"69734cb0","parentId":"04079c3e","timestamp":"2026-03-24T13:10:31.403Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Considering routing options**\n\nI think I need to provide an answer without using any tools. It seems like I might be focusing on routing, and perhaps I should mention that routing is one agent only. It's interesting to think about how routing can operate efficiently with the right configurations. I'll make sure to clarify my points so that everything is comprehensible for the user. Let's keep it straightforward and clear!","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_062252108ce08b250169c28d3801c881918453b2414cfdd78a\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpwo06jOSSJaCQ2Hc-N1GExihjuMa3iaSvq6MRzyaj8dmUCJL0vTo8v2KoK1IvSZIp_1EUqBlQ-HaZ9ePhxYKhuzJlJ88PcQ6p_dqt89Kme6f0Ruq04JO-10l-p0N7EZELGLvKQONWyNLW3OxVciuSCxCEsA820EOuqvE3W2hNIfD2YHTlJ-vhtewp1CMrLUZRkI7_1k_OVLgP-w9aZQfMgyVntPtVLuE_a446N1cqqjBN7ekxjONtVIFpJu0xoQzWS9tmURmnLVFQqHPsQG-lIyQlAoi494T8rnWvFERDl46rKonYBfSyhZmR7y4Kq9trV_eBBMGEMAXPiGh71R3gN_-EFBI1kTtiVVnY2V-dghmMBGC6YrA-qMU-D6BhUcXQT9hj8D0BCU5dqm2GiEVl6PIjnsnLSBPze8iv8vdPmLGQqrPGPs7TKJ4a4FEj-j6pX3rptHPQNNgalmvwQsYQHBCSpo819PZWOiVMcrb5LU5QZyW8I8SItEWRRxfQQWGdzjdWR3uz1jUo85_B1-vQajj6JiQAgykPa3Ic1WctILG70veX1ChIZ7IsIPq7Rhkzfn9sz-fKNo-HqOBdm6Isl4vvUKk1KbdShkwxuol00wjnr5R_WnRM8cHAuDGorn-muqESKZurl2cFXgy5YAwVo3GzqBHIYwbOsoo8D6KZmNCX6r4URVtJj2dN73w6tn9ZaE8RplZzcFnaKWKMW0RbZRKqFAkYyrvNc-ZCMX4aVDWK1hYE7cksFjITlfrvydYb0h3BERyfZhadhgmpgrRknoxn_sJAxC4vXQ4B-CltU6TDtysFCtp3M7cRuSbkdMrF9HKfBlo7KmUTHzdM4zwnKHqrWRNkjlrG-PIPA1-5SRFw4d1BdHgjwWQufbCxF1SqLt2haEN7NuZZNYr75CUc6ekpwQ==\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Considering routing options**\\n\\nI think I need to provide an answer without using any tools. It seems like I might be focusing on routing, and perhaps I should mention that routing is one agent only. It's interesting to think about how routing can operate efficiently with the right configurations. I'll make sure to clarify my points so that everything is comprehensible for the user. Let's keep it straightforward and clear!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]]\n不用都绑。**一个群只绑定一个主 agent**，不然容易乱。\n\n## 直接结论\n这个群建议 **绑定给 `main`**。\n\n## 原因\n因为这个群里虽然有：\n- `xixi`\n- `aoao`\n- `main`\n\n但这几个是**协作成员**，不是都要直接接群消息。\n\n群聊入口最好这样设计：\n\n- **群消息统一进 `main`**\n- `main` 判断任务类型\n- 需要调研就派给 `xixi`\n- 需要复核就派给 `aoao`\n\n这样最稳。\n\n## 为什么不要都绑定\n如果一个群同时绑多个 agent，会出几个问题：\n\n1. **谁都可能响应**\n   - 同一句话可能多人抢答\n   - 体验会很乱\n\n2. **职责边界变模糊**\n   - 用户不知道该 @谁\n   - agent 之间也容易重复劳动\n\n3. **排障更麻烦**\n   - 一旦群里没反应，很难判断是哪个绑定、哪个路由出了问题\n\n## 推荐方案\n这个群就这么配：\n\n- **群聊 `oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3` → 绑定给 `main`**\n- `xixi`、`aoao` 保持在后台协作，不直接做这个群的入口 agent\n\n## 一句话原则\n**入口只留一个，协作放后台。**\n\n如果你同意，我下一步就把这个群**绑定给 `main`**。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_062252108ce08b250169c28d3abdc48191b8df338fb7f9adda\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":784,"output":367,"cacheRead":72832,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":73983,"cost":{"input":0.0019600000000000004,"output":0.005505,"cacheRead":0.018208,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.025673}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774357809933}}
