{"type":"message","id":"6a2f24d2","parentId":"bc2a2781","timestamp":"2026-03-24T13:11:22.441Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]]\n好了，已经绑上了。\n\n## 已完成\n这个群现在已经绑定给 `main`：\n- `oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3` → `main`\n\n## 现在的结构\n- 这个群：`main` 作为入口\n- `xixi` / `aoao`：继续作为后台协作 agent，不直接抢群消息\n\n## 还差一步\n这个改动已经写进 `openclaw.json`，**但要让它生效，通常需要让 gateway 重新加载配置**。\n\n你现在可以先去群里试一句：\n- 直接 @我\n- 发一句“测试”\n\n如果还没反应，我下一步就处理 **gateway 重载/重启**。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_062252108ce08b250169c28d767b7c8191b3788aa3b3623da7\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":206,"output":175,"cacheRead":74368,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":74749,"cost":{"input":0.000515,"output":0.002625,"cacheRead":0.018592,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.021732}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774357872453}}
